      "id": "KA-C04-hoogu",
      "sequence": 210,
      "title": "ಹೋಗು (hōgu) — \"go,\" and ಬಾ (come)",
      "headword": "ಹೋಗು",
      "romanization": "hōgu",
      "gloss": "to go (and ಬಾ, come)",
